msgid "⟪k:0⟫—nothing. ⟪k:1⟫He could not speak."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫—nada. ⟪k:1⟫Ele não conseguia falar."

#: scenario:scenario_F3238D63_F0DF_4916_94E5_10AA2F5002F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0c7a8528cddace73a782c1810be5ecf3832f22a7d9b8b4b553bee69d8b71cc1b
#. default-sha256: b9cef689391a23cdf6c4d56844e70432c4c65262b3417267fcf6fc04d8d566ff
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F3238D63_F0DF_4916_94E5_10AA2F5002F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The silhouette hanging above him was certainly the White-Haired Girl’s. ⟪k:1⟫Or was it? ⟪k:2⟫"
"Because his next words were—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A silhueta suspensa acima dele era certamente a da Garota de Cabelos Brancos. ⟪k:1⟫Era? "
"⟪k:2⟫ Porque suas próximas palavras foram—"

#: scenario:scenario_71606EEB_9DAB_4875_B9AD_52E5AFA70C4E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f069477bdfbc516e12715c0c8d454bfd3cbded17199ca31448b5d0dad0d8fe28
