msgctxt "scenario:scenario_71606EEB_9DAB_4875_B9AD_52E5AFA70C4E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫G-⟪k:1⟫Get off me!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫S-⟪k:1⟫Saia de cima de mim!"

#: scenario:scenario_F3473CBE_D848_48B2_B063_CD14C0C95CF2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2da53f88047cfc8fe70ce4799148a6bea7ee076983e54d6900901179c75e6b8d
#. default-sha256: e392b6e483f63000a9027c1404455df47fdec529e3fc63c430a88d6b0f6d6529
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F3473CBE_D848_48B2_B063_CD14C0C95CF2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He reflexively shoved the girl straddling him aside."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Por reflexo, ele empurrou a garota montada nele para o lado."

#: scenario:scenario_1A37FEE3_0439_4DDF_B367_E6B25F979DAF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9a6c775c60e88bdd350b15cc7e2181e63b3ac0f34136554bf56078bc9ef997c
#. default-sha256: e9131fd6c910ec4c985c50922c2c749997fb40a423685b8e5fa74c3ffe6c8cc0
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1A37FEE3_0439_4DDF_B367_E6B25F979DAF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She rolled off the bed, landing on the cold floor, ⟪k:1⟫but slowly, gradually, she crawled "
"her way back toward him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela rolou para fora da cama, caindo no chão frio, ⟪k:1⟫mas lentamente, gradualmente, ela se "
"arrastou de volta para ele."

#: scenario:scenario_19CA1D14_E2F2_4A56_B339_D8285223D006
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c5a46b6bd57953ebfdc23ae4c17f0f5ba92ef9378b12875d2eb69e2f52ac2c2
#. default-sha256: ee147209755f495f78d7ce78c14c488771f83e365e91501aca90a0a242d0d300
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_19CA1D14_E2F2_4A56_B339_D8285223D006"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That wasn’t very nice..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Isso não foi muito legal..."

#: scenario:scenario_2B55BD27_3FD5_4A63_86AC_84FA9D2F569C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95f9a2d4e12434195c45a39350f8f3bef7a709b3847904d35625a05deafcd74d
#. default-sha256: bcc9c71398c3aa42d018caa721c4a530691674b3bdce9cd540eadf83c2f3b50e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2B55BD27_3FD5_4A63_86AC_84FA9D2F569C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Veiled in darkness, she slowly lifted her head. ⟪k:1⟫And then—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫there was another "
"flash of lightning.⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Velada pela escuridão, ela ergueu a cabeça lentamente. ⟪k:1⟫E então—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫houve outro "
"relâmpago.⟪k:4⟫"

#: scenario:scenario_AE6F7AD3_974C_4BEE_881E_691681260D1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee7ee23e64ab77f94a5e47e1d0f0de840500ed0f16b0c9a47cb939594e529a81
#. default-sha256: 8b7ba1624fbf99fa63a9b220894db2c3dbb3a6ba8c745e019d745e82f9d405b7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_AE6F7AD3_974C_4BEE_881E_691681260D1C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The heavy fabric of the curtains rustled, bolts of light streaming between the gaps."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫O tecido pesado das cortinas farfalhava, raios de luz fluíam entre as frestas."

#: scenario:scenario_E0BE2D06_DD56_40C9_863A_9A4AAF6A3D39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 807b3d756179b10765b586ea7629c92be8c1c7f7a42c82cfba1c11abc5c9b9b1
#. default-sha256: 4fbe1623e25ecb9207fc8c9c9a41c0fcba99ca3a913f4c0d88b26e64f5cb942a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E0BE2D06_DD56_40C9_863A_9A4AAF6A3D39"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Her flaxen irises glimmered. ⟪k:21⟫Though in the bluish-white light, they took "
"on a twinge of almost golden glow."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Suas íris cor de linho brilharam. ⟪k:21⟫Embora, sob a luz branco-azulada, "
"tenham assumido um súbito brilho quase dourado."

#: scenario:scenario_96413F74_9E88_415D_9DEB_7741E6D711E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d1254e08dc160bc439721fa84da4b285657aedbede78e1df1ee7c54db76aa45a
#. default-sha256: 8e75536617b11c5369dcf24e405649b4f85d1f4603f0ec6a8f96306c55d395b4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_96413F74_9E88_415D_9DEB_7741E6D711E4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No need to be so rough.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫This isn’t the first time she’s visited your bedchamber,"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫is it, Mell?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Não precisa ser tão rude.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Esta não é a primeira vez que ela visita seu quarto,⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫é, Mell?"

#: scenario:scenario_F689B45C_AAEA_445E_B158_18D9E7B52AA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d32fc4a79010877ca31cfb26cf5d35fac29830e9f3a49a9a0f2ae9146f9d77ff
#. default-sha256: b5d3937e142f2d4fe80ad2d6879b768b4edf00a597283f15cc503a177d30483a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F689B45C_AAEA_445E_B158_18D9E7B52AA2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Or did I not kiss you the same way?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tell me, how does she run her fingers across "
"your skin?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫What does she do when she nuzzles up to you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ou não te beijei do mesmo jeito?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Diga-me, como ela passa os dedos pela sua pele?"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫O que ela faz quando se aninha nos seus braços?"

#: scenario:scenario_706E20D7_6B3F_44A1_A31B_28781913B2C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 04e1ff68b3608a49310a393d216243e7a1187bb357cd7d34630859d16043c39a
#. default-sha256: 9dd52f617948afe7ad14eb4875592819b073e47e56c65e91d0f21d7c16fcbca1
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_706E20D7_6B3F_44A1_A31B_28781913B2C8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫S— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Stop— ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Stop this madness, ⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Nellie!⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Wh-"
"⟪k:11⟫Why would you... ⟪k:12⟫Why would you do this?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫P—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Pare—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Pare com essa loucura, ⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Nellie!⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫Por-⟪k:12⟫Por que você... ⟪k:13⟫Por que você faria isso?!"

#: scenario:scenario_0F60EA05_B15B_455C_9597_EE4D757E9178
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e39cb8d5a37ff6c49b85731a3399ff8cbd8d380257f1e081c9d14b13c06c934e
#. default-sha256: e294d7849cd7277a1f290e470293ad3fbddb001a87b3cb5fb6286afb51bf1835
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0F60EA05_B15B_455C_9597_EE4D757E9178"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Because you like white hair, don’t you, Mell?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You like white hair, which is why you "
"fell for her, isn’t it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Porque você gosta de cabelos brancos, não é, Mell?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Você gosta de cabelos brancos, e "
"é por isso que você se apaixonou por ela, não é?"

#: scenario:scenario_6584834B_2B27_4C60_BECD_C69EC8D9FC5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3743189bd2ee1d5188432e8db5420c20ea351fe0d0c88e2749dc0ad793845303
#. default-sha256: b87d7683428cbc89db27322846fb1f56b1011fa5a5d88592558bdb98aa3c36db
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6584834B_2B27_4C60_BECD_C69EC8D9FC5F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahaha... ⟪k:1⟫So if I have white hair, then you’ll fall for me too.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Then I can be "
"your princess again, dearest Mell."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahaha... ⟪k:1⟫Portanto, se eu tiver cabelos brancos, você também vai se apaixonar por mim."
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Então poderei ser sua princesa novamente, querido Mell."

#: scenario:scenario_0581AAED_B219_4E76_9F4C_F759584F14B8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50030fd4a477f9598f01872d11f806b34c1e157103e4522db381a4129c48b464
#. default-sha256: 835bfe8e5d2f103294ed337d111d24ca82025daaaf0d86cb691c37165e502f86
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0581AAED_B219_4E76_9F4C_F759584F14B8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What... ⟪k:1⟫What are you even talking about?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫O que...⟪k:1⟫Sobre o que é que você está falando?"

#: scenario:scenario_56C0EA79_04E3_4DF3_9393_D98EF0417E64
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0283bb38afb03e5be1eb014cde3438741dc5a35e2ab89587c3374f3e7c4d696f
#. default-sha256: 4c367eccea80f10121c050cf0e0540b724c5e1af4930e3893701d47fa0924692
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_56C0EA79_04E3_4DF3_9393_D98EF0417E64"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He could not escape from her—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫from his sister’s piercing gaze. ⟪k:3⟫“Why?” “What "
"happened?” “How could she?”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele não podia escapar dela—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫do olhar penetrante de sua irmã. ⟪k:3⟫“Por quê?” \"O "
"que aconteceu?\" \"Como ela pôde?\""

#: scenario:scenario_88E87D89_205B_45F5_854A_3EED23556195
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dfbd434ee55244ded52847634a25b8546c96cda881765750b9e54d04c453506c
#. default-sha256: c71b281389d9d8cb447a9d3cc55be32068291400ccb9512830433d298865ae91
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_88E87D89_205B_45F5_854A_3EED23556195"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Questions crashed into the young man’s mind like waves in a stormy sea."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Perguntas colidiram com a mente do jovem como ondas em um mar tempestuoso."

#: scenario:scenario_7E81027E_A71F_4178_9C1E_AC4E4ACCE1E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 453be3667dfa7d7e1deb45e3ab507c85ce1e0c20514d89c061e2a5b005138a66
#. default-sha256: e52685b53040a221bd60461ec98cc960a2e80bb5764a054950338e5a01f83e6f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7E81027E_A71F_4178_9C1E_AC4E4ACCE1E3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But none of them found answers; they simply caused him further perplexity."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas nenhuma delas encontrou resposta; elas simplesmente lhe causaram mais perplexidade."

#: scenario:scenario_B003D897_E99E_4E93_A1AF_0E6168B74274
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ca14abbcb0ee4081fc77c0a9993f05c39482df4fc3ed16c613aed34c66946d6
#. default-sha256: 83857461c73b09ec2d2535ea43c07a3b52b30521154672d04d78c2981abb926f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B003D897_E99E_4E93_A1AF_0E6168B74274"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Y-⟪k:1⟫Your hair...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫What happened to your hair?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫How did you... ⟪k:6⟫get it "
"that color?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫S-⟪k:1⟫Seu cabelo...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫O que aconteceu com seu cabelo?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Como você...⟪k:6⟫ "
"conseguiu essa cor?"

#: scenario:scenario_F013A957_0815_4057_962E_7B318845C66F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 263f6a5102551a223b02bbfbf622799b2a8edae35401ab6e92d76e2ec6078dee
#. default-sha256: a9c8760aa8752201f36d989f1612d652f5fae64081fca8a3b2ef376b1ad3ebe5
